# App Design — Auto-Trigger

When the user asks about creating screens, wireframes, visual design, themes, or design systems for TripPilot, read and follow `.cursor/skills/app-design/SKILL.md`.

## Trigger Patterns

- "crie as telas", "monte as telas", "gere os wireframes"
- "design do app", "visual do app", "tema do app"
- "como vai ficar o app", "crie o design system"
- "gere HTML das telas", "monte os HTMLs"
- "quero ver as telas", "me mostra como vai ficar"
- Any request involving creating visual mockups, wireframes, or design tokens

## Do NOT trigger for

- CSS fixes in existing code (that's normal coding)
- Questions about how the design skill works (just explain)
- Requests to review existing implementation code visually
